      "cost": 50,
      "summary": "An incredible way to experience [title] for the first time, a second time.",
      "excerpt": "Let me preface this with - if you haven't seen the anime, I can't really say if you'll enjoy it less or not, but you'll certainly be unable to appreciate a lot of what it does with the source material. I'll also be running on the assumption you've actually watched the anime first, because it's hard to talk about this manga at all if you haven't, and you really, really should! So, unmarked...",
